r the whereabouts of the missing Lord Mikage, the former god of the shrine.\n\nAfter her adventures in Izumo, Nanami meets Botanmaru, a tengu child looking for someone she knows all too well—tengu turned goth idol Shinjirou Kurama. Botanmaru needs Shinjirou, their prince, to return home to Mount Kurama and stop the tyranny of Jirou, who has taken over the rule of their hometown. However, Nanami soon discovers a force much darker than Jirou is at work on the mountain.\n\nAs a fledgling god becoming more accustomed to divinity, Nanami finds herself dealing with a tengu rebellion, her blooming feelings for Tomoe, and a strange man with ties to both Tomoe's past and Nanami's future.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Youkai","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Harem","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":54,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":30,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Cohabitation","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Kamisama Kiss◎","english":"Kamisama Kiss◎","native":"神様はじめました◎","romaji":"Kamisama Hajimemashita◎","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"元气少女缘结神◎"}]},"trailer":{"id":"ZMNdV7y7q1A","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZMNdV7y7q1A/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}